    "date": "2022-03-13T18:21:28+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Vernal (Spring) Equinox\n\nOn March 20th, the hours of daylight will equal the hours of darkness - 12 hours of daylight, 12 hours of darkness.\n\nSince February 1st, I have been stationary in New Mexico, resting, recovering, upgrading and refurbishing my bicycle.\n\nI will leave here and begin touring on March 19th, the day after the full moon, and the day before the Vernal equinox.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 1386,
    "date": "2022-03-13T18:21:38+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "",
