  {
    "id": 1398,
    "date": "2022-03-19T21:50:50+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Bicycle reconditioned. \n\nMany parts replaced. \n\nOn the road again.\n\nNice weather this time of year.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 1399,
    "date": "2022-03-22T22:32:51+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "1. Determination\n2. Preparedness \n3. Time, make it third.\n\nWhy Determination is first?\n\nBig change comes \nthrough Determination.\n\nDetermination requires persistence. \n\nYou must fight \nthe wind, rain and cold\nuntil nightfall \nif you must \nand then some.\n\nWe learn to see \ntime as irrelevant.\n\nEach passing year \nis as a day. \n\nNew mornings \ncome once each year. \n\nEach evening \nnever knowing \nwhere to sleep \nuntil arriving. \n\nEach morning \nnever knowing \nwhere is here \nuntil awakening. \n\nWe never leave \nthe past behind \nwhile the future is \nalways to come.",
    "media": null
  },
